Not bundled, deliberately
-------------------------

  * ARASAAC pictograms — property of the Gobierno de Aragón, created by Sergio
    Palao, distributed under CC BY-NC-SA. **Rampa does not bundle, redistribute
    or download them** (spec 018 FR-1601): NonCommercial is incompatible with
    Apache-2.0, and BY-NC-SA cannot be merged into our CC BY-SA content. A
    teacher fetches the set herself, under terms she accepts directly, and Rampa
    reads it from where she put it.

